From: accel-virt
Subject: [PATCH] Direct3D 11 predication skips draws and dispatches through conditional rendering

SetPredication resolves the occlusion or stream output overflow query on the GPU
into a predicate buffer and wraps draws and dispatches in conditional rendering,
so a draw is skipped when the query result equals the predicate value. Without
the extension predication stays a no-op.
---
